<title>USA: CBOE to begin trading 12 options on May 1, 2.</title>
<headline>CBOE to begin trading 12 options on May 1, 2.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said it will begin trading options on two stocks on May 1 and on 10 stocks on May 2.</p>
<p>The exchange said it will open trading options on Legg Mason Inc and Whittman-Hart Inc on May 1.</p>
<p>On May 2, trading will begin on options on shares of Bellwether Exploration Co, Cairn Energy USA Inc, CyberGuard Corp, Equity Corp International, Family Golf Centers Inc, First Commerce Corp, Globalstar Telecommunications Ltd, Hollinger International Inc, IPALCO Enterprises Inc and Sola International Inc, the CBOE said.  </p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
